History
-------

1.2beta1  Warp3D z-buffer clear (BlitzQuake); ogles2.library 1.4;
          anisotropic filtering, S3TC textures and multisampling in
          ogles2/ogles3; no false FPU warning.
1.1       New ogles3.library (OpenGL ES 3.0/3.1); faster ogles2 buffers,
          every ogles2 entry, shared contexts, bitmap contexts;
          minigl.library 30.0; agl rastport contexts; windows in front of
          3D windows kept; QuarkTexNGCheck.exe; host on OpenGL 4.3.
1.0beta3  New ogles2.library (OpenGL ES 2.0); several 3D programs at once;
          fullscreen screens in the mode of their size; Warp3D screen mode
          fixes; no FPU requester.
1.0beta2  minigl.library moved to MiniGL's 29 SDK (PiStorm3D 29.1): lighting,
          normal arrays, a GLU and GLUT subset. Programs built on an older
          MiniGL SDK need recompiling against the 29 SDK.
1.0beta   First release of QuarkTex NG.
